6346 0 obj
  << /ActualText (As the digital economy in Batam experiences exponential growth and the massive development of Data Center infrastructure\054 the need for fast\054 secure\054 and highly scalable connectivity becomes very crucial\056 Responding to this dynamic\054 PermanaNET is present as a strategic partner providing premium network infrastructure solutions\056 As illustrated in our network blueprint\054 we have built an existing fiber optic foundation that secures vital connectivity in the economic and technology centers of Batam\056 We offer Dark Fiber and DWDM \050Dense Wavelength Division Multiplexing\051 services specifically designed to accommodate high\055volume data traffic between Data Centers\054 Industrial Areas\054 and Landing Stations\054 so that we can ensure that the foundation of your digital business stands on a very strong infrastructure\056\n\nOur commitment goes beyond the boundaries of our current core infrastructure\056 Looking ahead\054 PermanaNET has finalized strategic plans through a massive expansion of new fiber optic networks for 2026\056 This infrastructure upgrade is designed to expand our service coverage to the western and southern areas of Batam\054 while also creating a highly redundant network system to ensure uninterrupted operations\056 This progressive step is a form of our dedication to weaving connectivity into the heart of community activities\054 providing inclusive and equitable digital access\056 Moreover\054 our service footprint is now not only centered in Batam\054 but has also expanded widely across strategic areas in Sumatra and the Riau Islands\056 To ensure that all of these visions and infrastructures operate perfectly\054 PermanaNET is supported by a comprehensive best\055in\055class service ecosystem\056 We rely on proactive network monitoring and technical experts who are always in a ready for service \050RFS\051 status to ensure that every Point of Presence \050PoP\051 operates at maximum performance whenever needed\056 Whether to accelerate local business growth or provide the convenience of internet connectivity at home\054 our philosophy remains one\072 delivering stable access without compromise to support your digital future\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 6347 0 R
     /Pg 3110 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

